TechMart Global Customer Support FAQ:
- Customer Hotline: 1-800-555-TECH (Operates 24/7)
- Operating Hours: 24 Hours a day, 7 days a week
- Physical Store Locations: New York, San Francisco, Chicago, London, Tokyo
- Standard Return Window: 30 days from delivery
